<title>CHINA: China's Jan-July rapeseed oil buying detailed.</title>
<headline>China's Jan-July rapeseed oil buying detailed.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following table shows the rapeseed oil import figures of five major Chinese customs offices as well as the country of origin during January-July 1996. Details were provided by the General Administration of Customs of China.</p>
<p>Figures are in tonnes. Percentage represents the market share.</p>
<p>-----</p>
<p>RAPESEED OIL</p>
<p> July imports: 24,420	Jan-July total imports: 226,939</p>
<p> CUSTOMS	   July	   Pct	  Jan-July    Pct</p>
<p> Jiulong	  6,275	  25.7	  161,729    71.2</p>
<p>(Shenzhen)</p>
<p> Tianjin		0	   0.0	   18,029     8.0</p>
<p> Haikou		 0	   0.0	   63,027    27.8</p>
<p> Nanning	 15,917	  65.1	   24,792    10.9</p>
<p> Xiamen		 0	   0.0	    2,991     1.3</p>
<p>ORIGINS</p>
<p> Germany	 12,904	  52.8	  104,531    46.0</p>
<p> Malaysia	   181	   0.7	   34,701    15.3</p>
<p> Netherlands    2,218	   9.1	   32,601    14.4</p>
<p> Canada	   3,918	  16.0	   25,238    11.1</p>
